#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:1
msgid "Expert Parallelism Load Balancer (EPLB)"
msgstr "专家并行负载均衡器 (EPLB)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:3
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:5
msgid ""
"Expert balancing for MoE (Mixture of Experts) models in LLM (Large Language)"
" serving is essential for optimal performance. Dynamically changing experts "
"during inference can negatively impact TTFT (Time To First Token) and TPOT "
"(Time Per Output Token) due to stop-the-world operations. Our solution aims "
"to minimize the negative impacts caused by the operation."
msgstr ""
"在LLM（大语言模型）服务中，对MoE（混合专家）模型进行专家均衡对于实现最佳性能至关重要。推理过程中动态变更专家会因全局停顿操作而对TTFT（首Token延迟）和TPOT（每输出Token延迟）产生负面影响。我们的解决方案旨在最小化该操作带来的负面影响。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:7
msgid "EPLB Effects"
msgstr "EPLB效果"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:9
msgid ""
"Reduced Latency: Dynamically balances expert loads to minimize TTFT and TPOT"
" by distributing workloads evenly across experts."
msgstr "降低延迟：通过将工作负载均匀分布到各专家，动态均衡专家负载以最小化TTFT和TPOT。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:10
msgid ""
"Adaptive Scaling: Automatically adjusts to workload fluctuations while "
"maintaining stable performance."
msgstr "自适应扩展：在保持稳定性能的同时，自动适应工作负载波动。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:12
msgid "Support Scenarios"
msgstr "支持场景"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:14
msgid "Models"
msgstr "模型"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:16
msgid ""
"All MoE models supported by vLLM-Ascend. But we have only verified the "
"performance on deepseek-v3.1/r1 models."
msgstr "vLLM-Ascend 支持所有 MoE 模型。但我们仅在 deepseek-v3.1/r1 模型上验证了性能。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:19
msgid ""
"[!IMPORTANT] Ascend 950 Products does not support using EPLB with quant type"
" \"W4A8MXFP4\", \"W4A16\", \"W4A16MXFP4\"."
msgstr ""
"[!IMPORTANT] Ascend 950 产品不支持将 EPLB 与量化类型 "
"\"W4A8MXFP4\"、\"W4A16\"、\"W4A16MXFP4\" 一起使用。"

