msgid "Usage Recommendations"
msgstr "使用建议"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:33
msgid ""
"EPLB is not recommended in the following scenarios because the load-"
"balancing benefit may not offset its runtime overhead:"
msgstr "在以下场景中不建议使用EPLB，因为负载均衡的收益可能无法抵消其运行时开销："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:35
msgid "P node workloads with input sequences shorter than `1024` tokens."
msgstr "P节点工作负载，输入序列长度小于`1024`个Token。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:36
msgid ""
"D node workloads where the number of experts per die is `<= 8` (`<= 16` on "
"950DT), or where the per-die load is below `128` tokens."
msgstr "D节点工作负载，每个Die的专家数`<= 8`（950DT上`<= 16`），或每个Die的负载低于`128`个Token。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:38
msgid ""
"[!WARNING] Meeting the above conditions may lead to performance degradation."
" When there are around 8 experts per die, the EPLB benefit may be comparable"
" to its overhead. Benchmark the actual workload and enable EPLB only after "
"confirming a performance gain."
msgstr ""
"[!WARNING] "
"满足上述条件可能导致性能下降。当每个Die约有8个专家时，EPLB的收益可能与开销相当。请对实际工作负载进行基准测试，并在确认有性能提升后再启用EPLB。"

