#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md
msgid "FlashLB"
msgstr "FlashLB"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md
msgid ""
"Statistical method using sliding-window mean/variance/covariance of expert "
"loads. Uses FlashTree layered search for optimal replica allocation and "
"`minimize_redeploy` for incremental adjustment. Best for high-frequency load"
" fluctuations."
msgstr ""
"统计方法，使用专家负载的滑动窗口均值/方差/协方差。使用FlashTree分层搜索进行最优副本分配，并使用`minimize_redeploy`进行增量调整。最适合高频负载波动场景。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:114
msgid "Selective Expert Heat Collection"
msgstr "选择性专家热度收集"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:116
msgid ""
"The `eplb_heat_collection_stage` option is intended for prefill-decode "
"aggregation scenarios. Prefill requests usually process many tokens in one "
"iteration, while decode requests usually process fewer tokens. As a result, "
"the expert workload distribution can differ between the two stages. "
"Collecting heat from both stages may hide the imbalance of the stage whose "
"latency you want to optimize."
msgstr ""
"`eplb_heat_collection_stage`选项适用于prefill-"
"decode聚合场景。Prefill请求通常在一次迭代中处理大量Token，而decode请求通常处理较少Token。因此，两个阶段的专家工作负载分布可能不同。从两个阶段收集热度可能会掩盖您想要优化延迟的那个阶段的不均衡情况。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:118
msgid ""
"[!IMPORTANT] Selective heat collection is currently implemented by the "
"Ascend model runner V1. Dynamic EPLB, including this option, is not yet "
"supported by the Ascend model runner V2."
msgstr "[!重要] 选择性热收集当前由Ascend模型运行器V1实现。包括此选项在内的动态EPLB尚不被Ascend模型运行器V2支持。"

