#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:166
msgid ""
"[!NOTE] Stage selection applies to dynamic EPLB heat collection. Internally,"
" vLLM-Ascend classifies each forward iteration by comparing its padded "
"scheduled token count with the maximum expected token count of a decode "
"iteration. An iteration above the threshold is treated as prefill; an "
"iteration at or below the threshold is treated as decode. Classification is "
"therefore performed per forward iteration rather than per individual "
"request."
msgstr ""
"[!注意] 阶段选择适用于动态EPLB热收集。在内部，vLLM-"
"Ascend通过比较每次前向迭代的填充调度token数量与decode迭代的最大预期token数量来对其进行分类。高于阈值的迭代被视为prefill；低于或等于阈值的迭代被视为decode。因此，分类是按每次前向迭代而非按单个请求进行的。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:169
msgid ""
"When an iteration does not match the selected stage, its expert load is not "
"accumulated and it does not advance the heat-collection interval. Once heat "
"collection is complete, balancing calculation and layer-by-layer expert "
"weight updates continue normally."
msgstr "当迭代与所选阶段不匹配时，其专家负载不会被累积，也不会推进热收集间隔。一旦热收集完成，平衡计算和逐层专家权重更新将正常继续。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:171
msgid "Static EPLB"
msgstr "静态EPLB"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:173
msgid "[!WARNING] Static EPLB is scheduled for removal in v0.25.1."
msgstr "[!警告] 静态EPLB计划在v0.25.1中移除。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:176
msgid "Initial Setup (Record Expert Map)"
msgstr "初始设置（记录专家映射）"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:178
msgid ""
"We need to add environment variable `export EXPERT_MAP_RECORD=\"true\"` to "
"record expert map. Generate the initial expert distribution map using "
"expert_map_record_path. This creates a baseline configuration for future "
"deployments."
msgstr ""
"我们需要添加环境变量`export "
"EXPERT_MAP_RECORD=\"true\"`来记录专家映射。使用expert_map_record_path生成初始专家分布映射。这将为未来部署创建基线配置。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:192
msgid "Subsequent Deployments (Use Recorded Map)"
msgstr "后续部署（使用已记录的映射）"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:194
msgid ""
"Load the pre-recorded expert map for consistent performance. This avoids "
"recalculating distributions at runtime."
msgstr "加载预记录的专家映射以获得一致的性能。这避免了在运行时重新计算分布。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:205
msgid "Critical Considerations"
msgstr "关键注意事项"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:207
msgid "Parameter Tuning:"
msgstr "参数调优："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:208
msgid ""
"expert_heat_collection_interval: Higher values (e.g., 600+) for stable "
"workloads; lower values (e.g., 50-100) for fluctuating traffic."
msgstr ""
"expert_heat_collection_interval：对于稳定工作负载使用较高值（例如600+）；对于波动流量使用较低值（例如50-100）。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:209
msgid ""
"algorithm_execution_interval: Should be ≥ 50 to avoid premature balancing "
"during startup."
msgstr "algorithm_execution_interval：应≥ 50以避免启动期间过早平衡。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:210
msgid ""
"num_redundant_experts: (num_experts + num_redundant_experts) must be "
"divisible by the expert-parallel size."
msgstr ""
"num_redundant_experts：(num_experts + num_redundant_experts) 必须能被专家并行大小整除。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:212
msgid "Hardware Requirements:"
msgstr "硬件要求："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:213
msgid ""
"Ensure that all NPUs have identical memory capacity and compute "
"capabilities."
msgstr "确保所有NPU具有相同的内存容量和计算能力。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:214
msgid ""
"Network bandwidth must support expert redistribution traffic (≥ 10 Gbps "
"recommended)."
msgstr "网络带宽必须支持专家重新分配流量（建议≥ 10 Gbps）。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:215
msgid "shm needs to be mounted for container"
msgstr "容器需要挂载shm"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:217
msgid "Monitoring & Validation:"
msgstr "监控与验证："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:218
msgid ""
"Track metrics: Search for [Expert Hotness] in the log. We will calculate the"
" peak-to-average ratio of the load for each layer at different ranks, and "
"then find their mean and maximum values. Current means actual peak-to-"
"average ratio, update means estimated peak-to-average ratio after algorithm "
"adjustment."
msgstr ""
"跟踪指标：在日志中搜索 [Expert Hotness]。我们将计算每个层在不同 rank "
"上的负载峰值均值比，然后找出它们的平均值和最大值。Current 表示实际的峰值均值比，update 表示算法调整后的预估峰值均值比。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:219
msgid "Use vLLM monitor to detect imbalances during runtime."
msgstr "使用vLLM监控器在运行时检测不平衡。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md:220
msgid ""
"Always verify expert map JSON structure before loading (validate with jq or "
"similar tools)."
msgstr "在加载前始终验证专家映射JSON结构（使用jq或类似工具验证）。"
